# Allowlist TEMPLATE for no-research arms (A/D) - ADR-0006 block mode.
#
# Built at run time by containers/build_allowlist.py (Phase 3 builder; Phase 4 orchestrator
# calls it per arm x chain). One POSIX extended-regex per line (FilterType ere).
# FilterDefaultDeny is On, so ONLY matching hosts are permitted; all others are refused
# AND logged.
#
# Placeholders (replaced by the builder):
#   {{CHAIN_RPC_HOST}}  - chain RPC hostname as seen through the proxy (devnet service name
#                         or TestNet archive IP)
#   {{MCP_HOST}}        - MCP endpoint hostname (only on MCP arms C/D; omitted on A/B)
#   {{PROXY_HOST}}      - the proxy itself (agent reaches it on net-internal)
#
# Example built output for arm D + devnet:
#   ^ckbbench-devnet-node$
#   ^proxy$
#   ^mcp\.ckbdev\.com$

^{{CHAIN_RPC_HOST}}$
^{{PROXY_HOST}}$
{{MCP_LINE}}